key:update.feature.dock	-	-	-	new Windows Update host text (design §3.7): what does not work without the Ubuntu Dock
key:update.post.upgraded	-	-	-	new Windows Update host text (design §3.7): post-upgrade notification title: first login on a new release, extension active
key:update.post.extOff	-	-	-	new Windows Update host text (design §3.7): post-upgrade notification title: the extension is OUT_OF_DATE (4) or INACTIVE (2) although enabled
key:update.post.extOffBody	-	-	-	new Windows Update host text (design §3.7): post-upgrade notification body
key:update.post.dockOn	-	-	-	new Windows Update host text (design §3.7): post-upgrade notification action
key:update.post.later	-	-	-	new Windows Update host text (design §3.7): post-upgrade notification action (the same word in both languages)
key:update.post.extError	-	-	-	new Windows Update host text (design §3.7): post-upgrade notification title: the extension is in ERROR (3)
key:update.post.extErrorBody	-	-	-	new Windows Update host text (design §3.7): post-upgrade notification body
key:update.post.extsOff	-	-	-	new Windows Update host text (design §3.7): post-upgrade notification title: org.gnome.shell disable-user-extensions is true
